    <sys:String x:Key="L_SetAbout_Desc">Invisible AI assistant for live calls, meetings and interviews. It listens to the call audio and your microphone, transcribes speech and suggests answers in a transparent overlay on top of all windows. It can also read your screen (OCR) and remember meeting facts.</sys:String>
