    <sys:String x:Key="L_SetAudio_ModeAdaptiveHint"> — the app measures speech rhythm and adapts the threshold to the speaker’s pace: fast speech → shorter pause, slow → longer.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L_SetAudio_ModeAutoNote">In auto modes the app only picks the pause (silence) threshold — its slider is hidden. All other settings below always apply.</sys:String>
